{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news","id":551533,"title":"Changeling News?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-12T08:14:44-07:00","id":551533,"title":"Changeling News?","content":"Just asking for any news on Changeling: the Dreaming. Is there still a 20th anniversary book still coming? Will the Menehune , the Inanimae, and the Hsien, get fixed and made playable. will the Native American Changeling get a book or PDf. What chance if any for details on Mexico and the Caribean? (the Kingdom of the Feathered Snake and the Fifes of Bright Promise)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T09:03:47-07:00","id":551621,"title":"","content":"The 20th anniversary edition is still coming. It's being written right now. When it's further along, I'm sure that Matt, the developer, will come around with answers to these questions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T01:59:03-07:00","id":554058,"title":"","content":"COnsidering the Hsien have a completley different set of themes, systems and mechanics, I doubt we will see them in Changeling 20. Just like we haven't seen the Kuei Jin in Vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T04:57:56-07:00","id":554151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=554058#post554058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">COnsidering the Hsien have a completley different set of themes, systems and mechanics, I doubt we will see them in Changeling 20. Just like we haven't seen the Kuei Jin in Vampire.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eddy Webb's basically said that the Kuei-jin need a greater overhaul than V20 has presently done - not that they're completely different from the core game, but that they need revising. (And this says absolutely nothing about which of Changeling's many sub-splats Matt's going to include.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T08:41:26-07:00","id":556920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=554151#post554151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eddy Webb's basically said that the Kuei-jin need a greater overhaul than V20 has presently done - not that they're completely different from the core game, but that they need revising. (And this says absolutely nothing about which of Changeling's many sub-splats Matt's going to include.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> KOTE have a number of unique mechanics and share very few mechanics with VTM vampires. As v20 and Da20 continue to assume they are something different including them in the v20 base book or DA book would have added a couple hundred more pages. Unless Hsien are loosing their &quot;not of the dreaming&quot; status and their almost sphere like magic system it would use up alot of pages.<br /> <br /> Now Denizens, Nunhei, Inanimae those might be more likely","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T09:37:14-07:00","id":557007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=556920#post556920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">KOTE have a number of unique mechanics and share very few mechanics with VTM vampires. As v20 and Da20 continue to assume they are something different including them in the v20 base book or DA book would have added a couple hundred more pages. Unless Hsien are loosing their &quot;not of the dreaming&quot; status and their almost sphere like magic system it would use up alot of pages.<br /> <br /> Now Denizens, Nunhei, Inanimae those might be more likely</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, figured out the KOTE bit after I originally posted.<br /> <br /> I do wonder just how many of Changeling's splats they can fit in the core: even leaving out the hsien, that's still 54/55 splats (15/16 Kithain, 8 Thallain, 4 Menehune, 14 Nunnehi, 6 Inanimae, 7 Denizens), many of which have their own mechanics.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T11:56:48-07:00","id":557181,"title":"","content":"They can make something similar to W20. All the basic Kithain in the corebook with some short descriptions of the other kiths/families at the end of the book, then a Book of Gallain like Changing Breeds for Werewolf. I'd really like can get something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/n6g3njp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/kpa5GS5Mp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/93820aaad7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/584-eliseo-ap-liam","name":"Eliseo ap Liam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T13:00:31-07:00","id":557227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eliseo ap Liam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=557181#post557181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They can make something similar to W20. All the basic Kithain in the corebook with some short descriptions of the other kiths/families at the end of the book, then a Book of Gallain like Changing Breeds for Werewolf. I'd really like can get something like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kiths are probably a lot easier to add onto the C20 core than Fera were to W20. Kiths, by and large, use the same chargen and powers. Fera typically have splats of their own to describe, along with peculiar Gift lists, rites, lengthy histories relating to the War of Rage, and unique systems that are a bit too bulky to really get into while also supplying everything for the Garou.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T14:48:17-07:00","id":557398,"title":"","content":"Well, would KotE 20 be the book that follows Changeling 20? Or would it be Demon 20?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T22:21:21-07:00","id":557907,"title":"","content":"V20 has 31 unique splats, not counting the write up for antitribu and 12 moralities so I think changeling could fit alot I mean it doesn't have as many Kith specific arts as there are wierd discplines for Masquerade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T15:25:15-07:00","id":558800,"title":"","content":"I'm so excited for this book. I can't say anything more intelligible because, argh!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T15:58:18-07:00","id":562284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=557227#post557227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kiths are probably a lot easier to add onto the C20 core than Fera were to W20. Kiths, by and large, use the same chargen and powers. Fera typically have splats of their own to describe, along with peculiar Gift lists, rites, lengthy histories relating to the War of Rage, and unique systems that are a bit too bulky to really get into while also supplying everything for the Garou.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. But We have more than 60 kiths. I don't think we're gonna get all those and some of their special magic systems (Inanimae's Slivers, Hsien's Wu Tans...) in the Changeling20 corebook (specially after how Wraith20 KS worked), so I believe that a brief splash for every family plus a Book of Gallain could be a good solution for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/n6g3njp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/kpa5GS5Mp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/93820aaad7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/584-eliseo-ap-liam","name":"Eliseo ap Liam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T17:05:39-07:00","id":562373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eliseo ap Liam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=562284#post562284\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah. But We have more than 60 kiths. I don't think we're gonna get all those and some of their special magic systems (Inanimae's Slivers, Hsien's Wu Tans...) in the Changeling20 corebook (specially after how Wraith20 KS worked), so I believe that a brief splash for every family plus a Book of Gallain could be a good solution for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>As others have noted, it'd be more likely that everything but the hsien get included, much as how V20 has yet to make any stand on KotE. Slivers aren't really that complicated or wordy, so they're just five more Arts, and the Realms are just renamed versions of standard Realms. That probably won't end up eating very much word count, even when you consider that you'll have to add some to actually write in the birthrights and frailities of the mannikins (none are present in the writeup of the mannikins in Inanimae).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T11:35:14-07:00","id":563180,"title":"","content":"Everything but the Hsien, would cover The 9 starter kiths, Sleikies, Ghile Dhu, Clurican, Piskies, Merfolk (14 Kiths), Nuneheinine, plus the one added in southeast USA book (14 more kiths), the nine Thallain kiths (the double Unseelie ones, five in shadow court, Spriggans, the Eshu Thallain and the River Hags, and the Murrucha), the four Menehene, and the five Inanamae. That seems like forty-four kiths. Were were the other 16?<br /> <br /> I just remembered that I forgot the Adrene (sic) Fuath, the Muses, the Fates, the Hindu disease Spirits, and the big bully things that seemed like a Sidhe Thaillain, which is five more. Only the Fuath seemed playable. But that means were eleven short of sixty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 06-22-2015, 01:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T11:58:45-07:00","id":563221,"title":"","content":"How do you get 14 Merfolk kiths? Even with the different houses, that's only three within one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T12:45:34-07:00","id":563301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=563180#post563180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Everything but the Hsien, would cover The 9 starter kiths, Sleikies, Ghile Dhu, Clurican, Piskies, Merfolk (14 Kiths), Nuneheinine, plus the one added in southeast USA book (14 more kiths), the nine Thallain kiths (the double Unseelie ones, five in shadow court, Spriggans, the Eshu Thallain and the River Hags, and the Murrucha), the four Menehene, and the five Inanamae. That seems like forty-four kiths. Were were the other 16?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> you forgot the adhene kiths that accounts for another seven.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5767-deedee","name":"DeeDee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T10:47:24-07:00","id":564288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=563221#post563221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do you get 14 Merfolk kiths? Even with the different houses, that's only three within one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I start with the nine kiths of the first book and add (Seilkies, Ghile Dhu, Cluricaun, Piskies, and Merfolk) five more. 9+5=14.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T10:52:47-07:00","id":564293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeeDee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/551533-changeling-news?p=563301#post563301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> you forgot the adhene kiths that accounts for another seven.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just remembered, but thank-you kindly because I only remembered five. Still, we're nine short of sixty.<br /> <br /> To make up the difference, they need to give us Peris! And a couple of Russian kiths too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:21:15-07:00","id":564548,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to seeing Changeling 20.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometime